abstract: "STTN-CP is a spatial-temporal Transformer network with contrastive pretraining for credit card fraud detection. The framework models spatial correlations among transaction features and temporal dependencies across transaction sequences using stacked spatial-temporal Transformer blocks with residual connections. Contrastive representation learning is used to improve feature discrimination, followed by binary fraud classification. The implementation supports Min-Max normalization, class-imbalance handling, sequence-based transaction processing, training, evaluation and reproducibility-oriented workflows."
